"I just wanted to write you a letter congratulating you
on your excellent technical support.  It is not often
that I would take the time to write such a letter but
this is really a special case.  I called your technical
support line about a problem with mouse interrupts using
MetaWINDOW.  I fully expected a long wait in the queue,
followed by advice from someone who would know little
more about the product than I did.   Imagine my surprise
when the phone was answered on the first ring by someone
who was not only technically competent but also
resourceful and - yes, actually CHEERFUL! (kind of rare
these days on tech support lines.)  Frankly, it made my
day and I thought you should know about it."
   M.Fishbaugher
   FISHBAUGHER & ASSOCIATES
   Cheshire, OR

